<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>链路追踪 - 分类 - 半生戎码</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/%E9%93%BE%E8%B7%AF%E8%BF%BD%E8%B8%AA/</link><description>半生戎码 - Jeff 的技术博客</description><generator>Hugo 0.170.1 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-rc.5</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</managingEditor><webMaster>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Fri, 06 Jan 2023 12:11:55 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/%E9%93%BE%E8%B7%AF%E8%BF%BD%E8%B8%AA/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>分布式链路追踪系列3-jaeger快速入门</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/jaeger/</link><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</author><guid>https://luzhifang.github.io/jaeger/</guid><category domain="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/%E9%93%BE%E8%B7%AF%E8%BF%BD%E8%B8%AA/">链路追踪</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="简介"&gt;&lt;span&gt;简介&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;受 Dapper 和 OpenZipkin 启发的 Jaeger 是由 Uber 开源的分布式跟踪系统，兼容 OpenTracing 标准。它用于监视和诊断基于微服务的分布式系统，功能包括：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>分布式链路追踪系列2-技术选型</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/tracing-tech-selection/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</author><guid>https://luzhifang.github.io/tracing-tech-selection/</guid><category domain="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/%E9%93%BE%E8%B7%AF%E8%BF%BD%E8%B8%AA/">链路追踪</category><description>&lt;p&gt;分布式链路追踪系统其中最著名的是 Google Dapper 论文所介绍的 Dapper。源于 Google 为了解决可能由不同团队，不同语言，不同模块，部署在不同服务器，不同数据中心的所带来的软件复杂性（很难去分析，无法做定位），构建了一个的分布式跟踪系统。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>分布式链路追踪系列1-OpenTracing 规范</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/opentracing/</link><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</author><guid>https://luzhifang.github.io/opentracing/</guid><category domain="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/%E9%93%BE%E8%B7%AF%E8%BF%BD%E8%B8%AA/">链路追踪</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="简介"&gt;&lt;span&gt;简介&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;OpenTracing 是一个中立的（厂商无关、平台无关）分布式追踪的 API 规范，提供了统一接口方便开发者在自己的服务中集成一种或者多种分布式追踪的实现。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>